  <History Date="25-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed first text only functions to locate at zero in attempt to fix bug report." />
  <History Date="26-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised pattern with Animation conditionals for Normal, Compressed and Extended modes and Pixel control function for Pixel mode." />
